# Spec 037, the render-level display tests: @D_NAME@. A small scene whose Display lines are the only
# thing that differs between the cases; the display search path names the fixture directories (and, for the
# hostile cases, the in-tree drivers).
Option "searchpath" "display" ["@D_SEARCH@"]
Format 8 8 1
PixelSamples 1 1
PixelFilter "box" 1 1
Projection "orthographic"
@D_PRE@
@D_DISPLAYS@
WorldBegin
@D_WORLD@
WorldEnd
